{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden","slug":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden","title":"The Snail in the Garden","title_ko":"정원의 달팽이","level":"A1","ageBand":"8-10","coverUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/cover.webp","summary_ko":"Jun이 정원에서 달팽이를 발견하고 자세히 관찰하며 신기함을 느껴요.","wordCount":92,"stage":2,"collection":"daily","pages":[{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p1","pageNo":1,"spread":"p1","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/p1.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p1-s1","ord":0,"text":"Jun went to the garden.","translation_ko":"Jun은 정원으로 나갔어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p1-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Jun","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":440},{"word":"went","charStart":4,"charEnd":8,"startMs":440,"endMs":800},{"word":"to","charStart":9,"charEnd":11,"startMs":800,"endMs":920},{"word":"the","charStart":12,"charEnd":15,"startMs":920,"endMs":1200},{"word":"garden","charStart":16,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1200,"endMs":1320}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p1-s2","ord":1,"text":"He saw something small and slow.","translation_ko":"그는 작고 느린 무언가를 발견했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p1-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"He","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":240},{"word":"saw","charStart":3,"charEnd":6,"startMs":240,"endMs":520},{"word":"something","charStart":7,"charEnd":16,"startMs":520,"endMs":980},{"word":"small","charStart":17,"charEnd":22,"startMs":980,"endMs":1480},{"word":"and","charStart":23,"charEnd":26,"startMs":1480,"endMs":1900},{"word":"slow","charStart":27,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1900,"endMs":2160}]}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p2","pageNo":2,"spread":"p2","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/p2.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p2-s1","ord":0,"text":"\"What is that?\" Jun said.","translation_ko":"\"저게 뭐지?\" Jun이 말했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p2-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"What","charStart":1,"charEnd":5,"startMs":0,"endMs":260},{"word":"is","charStart":6,"charEnd":8,"startMs":260,"endMs":560},{"word":"that","charStart":9,"charEnd":13,"startMs":560,"endMs":1360},{"word":"Jun","charStart":16,"charEnd":19,"startMs":1360,"endMs":1420},{"word":"said","charStart":20,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1420,"endMs":1760}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p2-s2","ord":1,"text":"It was a snail!","translation_ko":"달팽이였어요!","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p2-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"It","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":680},{"word":"was","charStart":3,"charEnd":6,"startMs":680,"endMs":920},{"word":"a","charStart":7,"charEnd":8,"startMs":920,"endMs":1220},{"word":"snail","charStart":9,"charEnd":14,"startMs":1220,"endMs":1420}]}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p3","pageNo":3,"spread":"p3","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/p3.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p3-s1","ord":0,"text":"The snail had a brown shell.","translation_ko":"달팽이는 갈색 껍데기를 가지고 있었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p3-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":640},{"word":"snail","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":640,"endMs":920},{"word":"had","charStart":10,"charEnd":13,"startMs":920,"endMs":1160},{"word":"a","charStart":14,"charEnd":15,"startMs":1160,"endMs":1400},{"word":"brown","charStart":16,"charEnd":21,"startMs":1400,"endMs":1640},{"word":"shell","charStart":22,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1640,"endMs":1960}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p3-s2","ord":1,"text":"Jun looked at it slowly.","translation_ko":"Jun은 천천히 그것을 들여다봤어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p3-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Jun","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":480},{"word":"looked","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":480,"endMs":920},{"word":"at","charStart":11,"charEnd":13,"startMs":920,"endMs":1140},{"word":"it","charStart":14,"charEnd":16,"startMs":1140,"endMs":1460},{"word":"slowly","charStart":17,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1460,"endMs":2020}]}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p4","pageNo":4,"spread":"p4","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/p4.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p4-s1","ord":0,"text":"The snail moved on a leaf.","translation_ko":"달팽이는 나뭇잎 위를 기어갔어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p4-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":260},{"word":"snail","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":260,"endMs":580},{"word":"moved","charStart":10,"charEnd":15,"startMs":580,"endMs":960},{"word":"on","charStart":16,"charEnd":18,"startMs":960,"endMs":1220},{"word":"a","charStart":19,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1220,"endMs":1420},{"word":"leaf","charStart":21,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1420,"endMs":1520}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p4-s2","ord":1,"text":"It moved very slowly.","translation_ko":"달팽이는 아주 천천히 움직였어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p4-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"It","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":240},{"word":"moved","charStart":3,"charEnd":8,"startMs":240,"endMs":600},{"word":"very","charStart":9,"charEnd":13,"startMs":600,"endMs":1260},{"word":"slowly","charStart":14,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1260,"endMs":1560}]}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p5","pageNo":5,"spread":"p5","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/p5.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p5-s1","ord":0,"text":"\"Come and look!\" Jun called.","translation_ko":"\"와서 봐봐!\" Jun이 불렀어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p5-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Come","charStart":1,"charEnd":5,"startMs":0,"endMs":880},{"word":"and","charStart":6,"charEnd":9,"startMs":880,"endMs":1200},{"word":"look","charStart":10,"charEnd":14,"startMs":1200,"endMs":2140},{"word":"Jun","charStart":17,"charEnd":20,"startMs":2140,"endMs":2240},{"word":"called","charStart":21,"charEnd":27,"startMs":2240,"endMs":2600}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p5-s2","ord":1,"text":"His mom came out and smiled.","translation_ko":"엄마가 나와서 미소 지었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p5-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"His","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":340},{"word":"mom","charStart":4,"charEnd":7,"startMs":340,"endMs":780},{"word":"came","charStart":8,"charEnd":12,"startMs":780,"endMs":1260},{"word":"out","charStart":13,"charEnd":16,"startMs":1260,"endMs":1520},{"word":"and","charStart":17,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1520,"endMs":1900},{"word":"smiled","charStart":21,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1900,"endMs":2220}]}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p6","pageNo":6,"spread":"p6","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/p6.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p6-s1","ord":0,"text":"\"It has two long horns,\" Jun said.","translation_ko":"\"더듬이가 두 개 있어요,\" Jun이 말했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p6-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"It","charStart":1,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":280},{"word":"has","charStart":4,"charEnd":7,"startMs":280,"endMs":600},{"word":"two","charStart":8,"charEnd":11,"startMs":600,"endMs":1160},{"word":"long","charStart":12,"charEnd":16,"startMs":1160,"endMs":1560},{"word":"horns","charStart":17,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1560,"endMs":2600},{"word":"Jun","charStart":25,"charEnd":28,"startMs":2600,"endMs":2660},{"word":"said","charStart":29,"charEnd":33,"startMs":2660,"endMs":2980}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p6-s2","ord":1,"text":"\"You are right,\" his mom said.","translation_ko":"\"맞아,\" 엄마가 말했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p6-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"You","charStart":1,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":260},{"word":"are","charStart":5,"charEnd":8,"startMs":260,"endMs":520},{"word":"right","charStart":9,"charEnd":14,"startMs":520,"endMs":1080},{"word":"his","charStart":17,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1080,"endMs":1300},{"word":"mom","charStart":21,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1300,"endMs":1500},{"word":"said","charStart":25,"charEnd":29,"startMs":1500,"endMs":1780}]}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p7","pageNo":7,"spread":"p7","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/p7.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p7-s1","ord":0,"text":"Jun watched the snail for a long time.","translation_ko":"Jun은 한참 동안 달팽이를 지켜봤어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p7-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Jun","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":600},{"word":"watched","charStart":4,"charEnd":11,"startMs":600,"endMs":1220},{"word":"the","charStart":12,"charEnd":15,"startMs":1220,"endMs":1620},{"word":"snail","charStart":16,"charEnd":21,"startMs":1620,"endMs":1920},{"word":"for","charStart":22,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1920,"endMs":2220},{"word":"a","charStart":26,"charEnd":27,"startMs":2220,"endMs":2440},{"word":"long","charStart":28,"charEnd":32,"startMs":2440,"endMs":2760},{"word":"time","charStart":33,"charEnd":37,"startMs":2760,"endMs":3160}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p7-s2","ord":1,"text":"But he did not touch it.","translation_ko":"하지만 그는 달팽이를 건드리지 않았어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p7-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"But","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":320},{"word":"he","charStart":4,"charEnd":6,"startMs":320,"endMs":560},{"word":"did","charStart":7,"charEnd":10,"startMs":560,"endMs":820},{"word":"not","charStart":11,"charEnd":14,"startMs":820,"endMs":1120},{"word":"touch","charStart":15,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1120,"endMs":1380},{"word":"it","charStart":21,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1380,"endMs":1540}]}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p8","pageNo":8,"spread":"p8","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/p8.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p8-s1","ord":0,"text":"\"Goodbye, snail,\" Jun said and went inside.","translation_ko":"\"잘 있어, 달팽이야,\" Jun이 말하고 집에 들어갔어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p8-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Goodbye","charStart":1,"charEnd":8,"startMs":0,"endMs":640},{"word":"snail","charStart":10,"charEnd":15,"startMs":780,"endMs":1440},{"word":"Jun","charStart":18,"charEnd":21,"startMs":1440,"endMs":1900},{"word":"said","charStart":22,"charEnd":26,"startMs":1900,"endMs":2180},{"word":"and","charStart":27,"charEnd":30,"startMs":2180,"endMs":2620},{"word":"went","charStart":31,"charEnd":35,"startMs":2620,"endMs":2840},{"word":"inside","charStart":36,"charEnd":42,"startMs":2840,"endMs":3440}]},{"id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-p8-s2","ord":1,"text":"He wanted to come back tomorrow.","translation_ko":"그는 내일도 다시 오고 싶었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden/audio/p8-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"He","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":220},{"word":"wanted","charStart":3,"charEnd":9,"startMs":220,"endMs":580},{"word":"to","charStart":10,"charEnd":12,"startMs":580,"endMs":900},{"word":"come","charStart":13,"charEnd":17,"startMs":900,"endMs":1140},{"word":"back","charStart":18,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1140,"endMs":1420},{"word":"tomorrow","charStart":23,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1420,"endMs":1820}]}]}],"quiz":[{"question_ko":"Jun은 정원에서 무엇을 발견했나요?","type":"mc","options":["달팽이","개구리","나비","지렁이"],"answerIndex":0,"explain_ko":"Jun은 정원에서 달팽이(snail)를 발견했어요.","id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-q1","ord":0},{"question_ko":"달팽이 껍데기는 무슨 색이었나요?","type":"mc","options":["하얀색","갈색","검은색","초록색"],"answerIndex":1,"explain_ko":"달팽이는 갈색(brown) 껍데기를 가지고 있었어요.","id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-q2","ord":1},{"question_ko":"Jun이 엄마를 불렀을 때 엄마는 어떻게 했나요?","type":"mc","options":["소리를 질렀어요","화를 냈어요","나와서 미소 지었어요","달팽이를 잡았어요"],"answerIndex":2,"explain_ko":"엄마는 나와서 미소 지었어요(smiled).","id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-q3","ord":2},{"question_ko":"Jun이 달팽이를 관찰하면서 하지 않은 행동은 무엇인가요?","type":"mc","options":["달팽이를 바라봤어요","엄마를 불렀어요","달팽이를 만졌어요","정원에 나갔어요"],"answerIndex":2,"explain_ko":"Jun은 달팽이를 건드리지(touch) 않았어요.","id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-q4","ord":3},{"question_ko":"Jun은 집에 들어가면서 어떤 마음이었나요?","type":"mc","options":["달팽이가 무서웠어요","내일 다시 오고 싶었어요","달팽이가 싫었어요","집에 있고 싶지 않았어요"],"answerIndex":1,"explain_ko":"Jun은 내일 다시 정원에 오고 싶었어요.","id":"daily-167-the-snail-in-the-garden-q5","ord":4}]}